Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]finish_dh_canonical_archive.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-e7[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-e7/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restrict plan-header parsing to the leading block[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]header-block[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]header-block: stop the Rust plan-header parser from scanning the whole [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]document body, so an ordinary known-label bullet no longer invalidates a[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan; publish the fix in a core release, raise the Python floor to it, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and drop the plans-sidecar wording workaround.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every prompt interface canonical[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]canonical-interfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]canonical-interfaces: retire the export path that writes prompt Markdown[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into the plans store, retarget prompt search at the canonical agents [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]archive, delete plans-snapshot discovery once nothing calls it, and add [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the regression test that enforces the invariant.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make agent prompts migrate correct and durable[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]migrate-durability[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dep